findings.suggested_fix:
Validate that the redirect target stays on the same host before redirecting. Example:

```python
from urllib.parse import urlparse, urljoin

def is_safe_url(target, host):
    ref_url = urlparse(urljoin(request.host_url, target))
    return ref_url.netloc == host

@app.route("/login")
def login():
    next_url = request.args.get("next", "/")
    # ... authentication happens here ...
    if not is_safe_url(next_url, request.host):
        next_url = "/"
    return redirect(next_url)
```

